# .env.example: template of the settings/secrets this project needs.
# Copy it:  cp .env.example .env   then put real values in .env (which Git ignores).
# This file IS committed, so it must only ever contain names and safe placeholders.
#
# Phase 0 needs no secrets yet. Each phase adds its variables here, e.g.:
# SOME_SERVICE_PASSWORD=change-me
